      "disposition": "shared_ordered_vocabulary",
      "assessment": "Four literal five-dimension lists define the same priced/reconciled vocabulary. UsageEnvelope.token_dimensions/0 derives the same list from a six-field raw envelope. Components.selected_alternative uses list order when all present alternatives are zero, and component output follows that order. Preserve order, not just set membership. A low-dependency Usage.Dimensions owner as recommended by telemetry-usage-34 is appropriate; avoid introducing a compile-time call from RelationshipRegistry back into the envelope struct it already consumes.",
      "related_finding": "telemetry-usage-34"
    },
