      "disposition": "shared_transport_identity_distinct_event_contracts",
      "assessment": "All 15 declarations and attribute references inspected. They refer to the same named Phoenix PubSub transport, while topics, payloads, subscribe/broadcast behavior, missing-process handling and broadcast_from usage differ. The identity is already shared; do not count each spelling as duplicated bus implementation. Event boundaries should own topics and payloads; any transport injection belongs at composition boundaries, not a universal merged event API."
